<!--
  The Deep V6 ground, hand-mirrored (design_system.md §1.1, D-247).

  NO GATE LANE CHECKS THIS FILE AGAINST tokens.dart — the same §9.1 obligation
  RevealActivity.kt carries. If KvColor.abyss changes, change it here in the
  same commit.

  This is the colour the OS paints BEFORE Flutter's first frame. It was
  `@android:color/white` on a dark-only wallet, so every cold start opened with
  a white flash (ux-auditor, UX-R0). Declared once and used by both the launch
  drawable and NormalTheme, in both the day and night value sets, because a
  dark-only app has no day answer that differs.
-->
<resources>
    <color name="kv_abyss">#FF0A0D0D</color>
</resources>
